---
import Base from "../../../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base title="石笼网箱与石笼网 — 尺寸、价格与安平工厂" description="焊接和编织石笼网：标准尺寸、网格规格、涂层和填充指南。安平工厂直供。" lang="zh">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 py-12 flex flex-col lg:flex-row gap-8">
    <!-- Main Content -->
    <article class="flex-1 min-w-0 prose">
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-theme-primary">石笼网箱</h1>
      <p class="text-theme-secondary">石笼是填充石块的钢丝网箱，用于挡土墙、河岸防护、侵蚀控制和景观设计。安平供应两种类型：<strong>焊接石笼</strong>（刚性、外观整齐，欧洲建筑景观常用）和<strong>编织六角石笼</strong>（柔性、便宜，土木工程标准）。</p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-theme-primary">标准网箱尺寸</h2>
      <table>
        <thead><tr><th>类型</th><th>常见尺寸 (m)</th><th>网格</th><th>丝径</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td>焊接</td><td>1×1×1, 2×1×1, 2×0.5×0.5, 1×0.5×0.5</td><td>50×50, 75×75, 100×100 mm</td><td>3.0–5.0 mm (+PVC)</td></tr>
          <tr><td>编织（六角）</td><td>2×1×1, 3×1×1, 4×1×1, 2×1×0.5</td><td>60×80, 80×100, 100×120 mm</td><td>2.0–3.0 mm (2.4/3.4 含PVC)</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-theme-primary">镀锌选项</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>高尔凡 (Zn-5%Al)</strong> — 土木工程最佳性价比，寿命是普通锌的 2–3 倍</li>
        <li><strong>热镀锌</strong> — 60–100 g/m² 锌层</li>
        <li><strong>镀锌 + PVC 涂层</strong> — 绿/灰，建筑和海洋用途</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-theme-primary">如何评估石笼报价</h2>
      <ol>
        <li>检查网格尺寸——焊接石笼按 m² 或按个报价；编织按 m²</li>
        <li>丝径（涂层前）和锌层重量（g/m²）</li>
        <li>网片或卷网来源——有些供应商外购网片只做组装</li>
        <li>配件：螺旋丝、卡扣、加固/支撑丝（常被排除但必需！）</li>
        <li>每柜平装体积——焊接石笼拆平运输，40'高柜约 15–20 m³</li>
      </ol>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-theme-primary">价格参考</h2>
      <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-4">
        <table class="w-full text-sm border-collapse">
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th class="text-left p-3 border border-theme bg-theme-tertiary font-semibold text-theme-primary">产品</th>
              <th class="text-left p-3 border border-theme bg-theme-tertiary font-semibold text-theme-primary">规格</th>
              <th class="text-left p-3 border border-theme bg-theme-tertiary font-semibold text-theme-primary">价格范围 (USD)</th>
              <th class="text-left p-3 border border-theme bg-theme-tertiary font-semibold text-theme-primary">MOQ</th>
              <th class="text-left p-3 border border-theme bg-theme-tertiary font-semibold text-theme-primary">交货期</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="border-b border-theme">
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">焊接石笼, 1×1×1m</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">50×50mm, 4.0mm 丝, 高尔凡</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">$18–28/个</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">200 个</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">15–25 天</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-theme">
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">焊接石笼, 2×1×1m</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">75×75mm, 4.0mm 丝, 高尔凡</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">$28–42/个</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">200 个</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">15–25 天</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-theme">
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">编织石笼（每 m²）</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">80×100mm, 2.7mm 丝, PVC</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">$3.5–6/m²</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">5000 m²</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">15–20 天</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-theme">
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">PVC 涂层焊接石笼</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">50×50mm, 4.0mm+0.5mm PVC</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">$22–35/个 (1×1×1m)</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">200 个</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">20–30 天</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-theme">
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">螺旋丝 & 卡扣（套）</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">适用 1×1×1m 网箱</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">$1.5–2.5/套</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">500 套</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">10–15 天</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
      <p class="text-xs text-theme-muted mb-6">*2025–2026 年指示性价格范围。实际价格取决于丝材成本、锌层重量、订单量和目的港。请务必索取包含配件明细的正式报价。</p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-theme-primary">常见问题</h2>
      
      <details class="mb-3 border border-theme rounded-lg bg-theme-card">
        <summary class="font-semibold cursor-pointer p-4 text-theme-primary hover:text-theme-accent transition">1×1×1 m 网箱能装多少石头？</summary>
        <p class="text-sm mt-2 px-4 pb-4 text-theme-secondary">约 1.5–1.7 吨 100–200 mm 石块。石材当地采购——运输石头永远不经济。</p>
      </details>
      
      <details class="mb-3 border border-theme rounded-lg bg-theme-card">
        <summary class="font-semibold cursor-pointer p-4 text-theme-primary hover:text-theme-accent transition">焊接 vs 编织——我的项目该选哪个？</summary>
        <p class="text-sm mt-2 px-4 pb-4 text-theme-secondary">焊接：建筑、景观、笔直墙体、寿命更长。编织：河道工程、大坝、不平地形——柔韧不易断裂。</p>
      </details>
      
      <details class="mb-3 border border-theme rounded-lg bg-theme-card">
        <summary class="font-semibold cursor-pointer p-4 text-theme-primary hover:text-theme-accent transition">典型 MOQ？</summary>
        <p class="text-sm mt-2 px-4 pb-4 text-theme-secondary">一柜网箱（通常 200–400 个焊接或 5000+ m² 编织）。安平工厂接受混装尺寸集装箱。</p>
      </details>
      
      <details class="mb-3 border border-theme rounded-lg bg-theme-card">
        <summary class="font-semibold cursor-pointer p-4 text-theme-primary hover:text-theme-accent transition">什么是高尔凡？为什么更好？</summary>
        <p class="text-sm mt-2 px-4 pb-4 text-theme-secondary">高尔凡是锌铝合金涂层（Zn-5%Al）。腐蚀防护是普通热镀锌的 2–3 倍，成本仅高 ~15%。50 年以上设计寿命的土木工程标准配置。</p>
      </details>
      
      <details class="mb-3 border border-theme rounded-lg bg-theme-card">
        <summary class="font-semibold cursor-pointer p-4 text-theme-primary hover:text-theme-accent transition">现场如何组装石笼网箱？</summary>
        <p class="text-sm mt-2 px-4 pb-4 text-theme-secondary">网箱拆平运输。用螺旋丝（焊接）或绑扎丝（编织）连接侧板。填充时每 1m 加支撑丝防止鼓胀。分 250mm 层填充，表面手工摆石美观。</p>
      </details>
      
      <details class="mb-3 border border-theme rounded-lg bg-theme-card">
        <summary class="font-semibold cursor-pointer p-4 text-theme-primary hover:text-theme-accent transition">用什么尺寸的石块？</summary>
        <p class="text-sm mt-2 px-4 pb-4 text-theme-secondary">结构石笼用 100–200 mm（4–8 英寸）棱角石。装饰可用圆润河石。石材莫氏硬度需 >3 抗破碎。孔隙率 ~30–35% 利于排水。</p>
      </details>
      
      <details class="mb-3 border border-theme rounded-lg bg-theme-card">
        <summary class="font-semibold cursor-pointer p-4 text-theme-primary hover:text-theme-accent transition">如何计算集装箱能装多少石笼？</summary>
        <p class="text-sm mt-2 px-4 pb-4 text-theme-secondary">使用我们的<a href="/zh/tools/container-loading-calculator/" class="text-theme-accent">集装箱装载计算器</a>——选择"石笼网箱"产品类型，输入网箱尺寸和数量。焊接石笼拆平装运，最大化集装箱空间。</p>
      </details>

      <div class="not-prose mt-8 bg-theme-secondary text-white rounded-xl p-6">
        <p class="font-semibold text-lg">获取安平石笼工厂报价</p>
        <a href="/zh/inquiry/" class="inline-block mt-3 accent-bg hover:accent-bg font-semibold px-5 py-2.5 rounded-lg transition-colors">发送询盘 →</a>
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- Sidebar -->
    <aside class="lg:w-80 shrink-0">
      <div class="sticky top-24 space-y-6">
        <!-- Quick Tools -->
        <div class="bg-theme-card border border-theme rounded-lg p-5">
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-theme-accent tracking-widest mb-3">快速工具</p>
          <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-theme-primary mb-3">计算与转换</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm">
            <li>
              <a href="/zh/tools/welded-wire-mesh-weight-calculator/" class="text-theme-secondary hover:text-theme-accent transition flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="text-theme-accent">→</span> 重量计算器
              </a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <a href="/zh/tools/container-loading-calculator/" class="text-theme-secondary hover:text-theme-accent transition flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="text-theme-accent">→</span> 集装箱装载
              </a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <a href="/zh/tools/fob-price-calculator/" class="text-theme-secondary hover:text-theme-accent transition flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="text-theme-accent">→</span> FOB 价格计算器
              </a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <a href="/zh/charts/mesh-size-chart/" class="text-theme-secondary hover:text-theme-accent transition flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="text-theme-accent">→</span> 规格表
              </a>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- Quick Specs -->
        <div class="bg-theme-card border border-theme rounded-lg p-5">
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-theme-accent tracking-widest mb-3">快速规格</p>
          <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-theme-primary mb-3">石笼标准</h3>
          <dl class="space-y-2 text-xs">
            <div class="flex justify-between">
              <dt class="text-theme-muted">网箱尺寸</dt>
              <dd class="text-theme-primary">1×1×1 to 4×1×1 m</dd>
            </div>
            <div class="flex justify-between">
              <dt class="text-theme-muted">焊接网格</dt>
              <dd class="text-theme-primary">50×50 to 100×100 mm</dd>
            </div>
            <div class="flex justify-between">
              <dt class="text-theme-muted">编织网格</dt>
              <dd class="text-theme-primary">60×80 to 100×120 mm</dd>
            </div>
            <div class="flex justify-between">
              <dt class="text-theme-muted">丝径</dt>
              <dd class="text-theme-primary">2.0–5.0 mm</dd>
            </div>
            <div class="flex justify-between">
              <dt class="text-theme-muted">涂层</dt>
              <dd class="text-theme-primary">高尔凡 / 热镀锌<br/>+PVC 可选</dd>
            </div>
            <div class="flex justify-between">
              <dt class="text-theme-muted">标准</dt>
              <dd class="text-theme-primary">ASTM A975<br/>EN 10223-8</dd>
            </div>
          </dl>
        </div>

        <!-- Related Products -->
        <div class="bg-theme-card border border-theme rounded-lg p-5">
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-theme-accent tracking-widest mb-3">相关产品</p>
          <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-theme-primary mb-3">相关产品</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm">
            <li>
              <a href="/zh/products/welded-wire-mesh/" class="text-theme-secondary hover:text-theme-accent transition flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="text-theme-accent">→</span> 焊接网
              </a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <a href="/zh/products/stainless-steel-wire-mesh/" class="text-theme-secondary hover:text-theme-accent transition flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="text-theme-accent">→</span> 不锈钢丝网
              </a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <a href="/zh/products/wire-mesh-fence-panels/" class="text-theme-secondary hover:text-theme-accent transition flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="text-theme-accent">→</span> 护栏网片
              </a>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </aside>
  </div>
</Base>
